    "ym": "2026-11",
    "pub": "2026-11-06",
    "text": "We inform you that there has been an update in the class schedule – classes Basic Legal Knowledge (changes on 18.11 and 20.01) Rozkłady zajęć – Wydział Prawa i Administracji Uniwersytetu Szczecińskiego"
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/11/iebl-2nd-year-cancellation-of-classes-on-4-11-2026/",
    "title": "IEBL – 2nd year – cancellation of classes on 4.11.2026",
    "ym": "2026-11",
    "pub": "2026-11-04",
    "text": "Environmental Law and Business class (dr A. Ogonowska) on November 4, 2026, will not take place."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/11/iebl-2nd-year-changed-class-schedule-spanish-language/",
    "title": "IEBL – 2nd year – changed class schedule (Spanish language)",
    "ym": "2026-11",
    "pub": "2026-11-03",
    "text": "There has been a change in the class schedule – the updated schedule is on the website Rozkłady zajęć – Wydział Prawa i Administracji Uniwersytetu Szczecińskiego"
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/2026/10/1-st-iebl-ma-studies-results-of-registration-for-elective-course-4/",
    "title": "1 st. IEBL MA studies – results of registration for Elective course",
    "ym": "2026-10",
    "pub": "2026-10-28",
    "text": "We would like to inform you that in the summer semester of 2026/2027 the subjects will be carried out for all students: European Competition Law (europejskie prawo konkurencji); Cybersecurity and Business (cyberbezpieczeństwo w biznesie)."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/10/iebl-2nd-year-make-up-session-for-the-diploma-seminar-dr-habil-k-niziol-prof-us/",
    "title": "IEBL 2nd year -Make-up session for the diploma seminar (dr. habil. K. Nizioł, prof. US)",
    "ym": "2026-10",
    "pub": "2026-10-27",
    "text": "The sessions of the diploma seminar that did not take place on 13 October 2026 will be held on 17 November 2026 from 17:45 –8.15 pm in room 322, and on 24 November 2026 from 6.15 pm–7.00 pm in room 322."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/10/1st-iebl-ma-studies-change-of-class-schedule-basic-legal-knowledge/",
    "title": "1st IEBL MA studies – change of class schedule (Basic Legal Knowledge)",
    "ym": "2026-10",
    "pub": "2026-10-21",
    "text": "The Basic Legal Knowledge class on October 28 has been moved to December 9 from 1:30 PM to 4:45 PM, room 217 Narutowicza. Classes on 18.11 will take place from 1:30 PM to 3:00 PM. The date for completing the remaining 2 hours will be announced soon."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/10/odwolane-konsultacje-dr-hab-a-kosinskiej-prof-us-w-dn-15-10-2026-r/",
    "title": "Odwołane konsultacje dr hab. A. Kosińskiej, prof. US w dn. 15.10.2026 r.",
    "ym": "2026-10",
    "pub": "2026-10-15",
    "text": "Informujemy, że konsultacje dr hab. A. Kosińskiej, prof. US w dniu 15.10.2026 r. nie odbędą się."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/2026/10/1-st-iebl-ma-studies-registration-for-elective-subjects-15-10-20-10-2026/",
    "title": "1 st IEBL MA studies – Registration for elective subjects (15.10 – 20.10.2026)",
    "ym": "2026-10",
    "pub": "2026-10-14",
    "text": "Uprzejmie informujemy, że w dniach od 15 do 20 października 2026 r. zostaną uruchomione (poprzez system e-prodziekan) zapisy na przedmiot do wyboru 1 oraz 2 realizowane na pierwszym roku studiów w semestrze letnim (drugim) r.a. 2026/2027. Studenci dokonują wyboru jednego przedmiotu spośród każdego z modułów przedmiotu do wyboru. Elective course 1 (przedmiot do wyboru 1) [moduł]: Cybersecurity and Business (cyberbezpieczeństwo w biznesie), Employment Law (prawo pracy) ; Elective course 2 (przedmiot do wyboru 2) [moduł]: European Competition Law (europejskie prawo konkurencji) , European Private International Law (europejskie prawo prywatne międzynarodowe). Wyniki zapisów zostaną podane do wiadomości w formie ogłoszenia. We inform you that from 15 to 20 October 2026 , registrations for elective courses 1 and 2 , conducted in the first year of study in the summer semester (second) of the 2026/2027 academic year, will be launched. Students choose one course from each of the modules of the elective course. Elective course 1 (przedmiot do wyboru 1) [moduł]: Cybersecurity and Business (cyberbezpieczeństwo w biznesie), Employment Law (prawo pracy) ; Elective course 2 (przedmiot do wyboru 2) [moduł]: European Competition Law (europejskie prawo konkurencji) , European Private International Law (europejskie prawo prywatne międzynarodowe). The results of the registrations will be announced in the form of a notice."
   },
   {
    "url": "https://dos.usz.edu.pl/narutowicza/zajecia-narutowicza/2026/10/iebl-2-nd-year-absence-of-dr-habil-k-niziol-prof-us-on-13-10-2026-diploma-seminar/",
